    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging Our Atelier platform and integrating Our Atelier platform with the client's existing infrastructure, our can provide a comprehensive solution that addresses the client's requirements for quick access to information, assistance in drafting professional documents, support in handling client files, and collaboration and mission continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable), and all AI outputs must be explainable and auditable a posteriori." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's personal-data protection obligations are limited to GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls can we propose to ensure confidentiality, integrity, and availability of client data? we can propose several security controls to ensure confidentiality, integrity, and availability of client data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For confidentiality, we hosting partner OuraneCloud provides a SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure, ensuring that all data is hosted within EU and not transferred outside. our hosting partner OuraneCloud also implement encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and at rest using AES-256, as well as pseudonymisation where applicable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For integrity, our hosting partner OuraneCloud have strict partitioning of client files with logical isolation per client and per mission, and access controls that prevent cross-client circulation of data. our hosting partner OuraneCloud secure software development life cycle includes code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external provider equivalent to CREST level. our hosting partner OuraneCloud also have a vulnerability management process with remediation SLAs based on severity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For availability, our hosting partner OuraneCloud incident response plan includes detection, notification, and remediation, including compliance with the 72-hour GDPR breach-notification workflow. our hosting partner OuraneCloud also ensure segregation of duties between development and production operations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, all figures and factual statements produced by we product Atelier are grounded in sources and can be retrieved for audit purposes, ensuring explainability and audibility a posteriori. we data protection measures include configurable retention aligned with legal archival obligations, role-based access control, and audit logging of access and system outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A Data Protection Officer is also appointed to oversee these processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict compliance with professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data; no decision may be automated without explicit validation by an authorised professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "All deliverables must be validated by a chartered accountant or statutory auditor." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with the regulatory requirements, including anti-money-laundering obligations (LCB-FT) and legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As Legal Agent of we, Legal Agent of Faber IA have reviewed we context and the tender requirements. we must flag the following legal risks: non-compliance with professional secrecy and confidentiality obligations, potential automation of decisions without proper validation, and failure to obtain validation from a chartered accountant or statutory auditor for all deliverables." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding compliance with regulatory requirements, we is familiar with the contractual expectations of clients bound by professional secrecy. we ensure that we contractual framework does not compromise we professional obligations, including those related to confidentiality and secrecy. we are also compliant with anti-money-laundering regulations (LCB-FT) as part of we monitored obligations, which include GDPR, professional secrecy, and auditor-independence and separation-of-duties rules for statutory audit." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we comply with legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents. we platform IP model is based on proprietary software licensed to clients under a subscription or usage model, ensuring that client data ownership is retained by clients. we also provide administrative attestations, including those related to we compliance with social and fiscal obligations, which can be made available upon request." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, Legal Agent of Faber IA must note that while we have professional liability insurance coverage of up to 10 million euros per claim, we do not have specific information on The tender requirements regarding insurance coverage." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; the professional validates.  3.3 Client-file handling support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, we general civil liability cover is in place, ensuring that we are covered for any potential claims arising from we services." ;
