    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In conclusion, based on we company context, we appear to be compliant with the regulatory requirements mentioned, including anti-money-laundering obligations and legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents." ;
