    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context at Faber IA, our platform Atelier can be leveraged to design an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that meets the client's requirements.  our platform Atelier can utilize our platform Atelier retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities, which enable every answer to be generated from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus and cited in passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus." ;
