        ex:hasText "Quick access to reliable, up-to-date information drawn from accounting standards (PCG), tax doctrine and the tax code (CGI), the commercial code and applicable legal texts, collective-bargaining agreements for payroll/social, and Cabinet Vauclair & Associés internal procedures and methodology guides." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Quick access to reliable, up-to-date information: FULLY COVERED our Atelier platform provides a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capability, which includes a document-ingestion pipeline, vector store, and hybrid search functionality, enabling quick access to reliable information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our Atelier platform answer layer also ensures that responses are grounded in cited sources. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting professional documents: FULLY COVERED Our Atelier platform can assist with drafting professional documents through Our Atelier platform generation capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our Atelier platform orchestration layer routes queries through retrieval, generation, and post-processing, ensuring that generated content is accurate and relevant. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Support in handling client files: PARTIALLY COVERED While Our Atelier platform provides some support for handling client files through Our Atelier platform information extraction and retrieval capabilities, Our Atelier platform does not directly address the full range of requirements related to client file handling, such as preparation of recurring documents or flagging potential anomalies." ;
